NOTE: 

streamfunction1 is for particle_tracking1

The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

particle_tracking1

 Stokes problem on a unit square with Dirichlet boundary conditions.
 Periodic cavity flow.
 Tracking of an initially circular interface.

particle_tracking2

 Stokes problem on a unit square with Dirichlet boundary conditions.
 Periodic cavity flow.
 Tracking of an initially circular interface.
 Using the option to reorder the nodes of a pcurve for easier post-processing
 Matlab file for plotting the particle using the reordered pcurve coordinates
